statx - read inode metadata including mode and ownership

SYNOPSIS
    int statx(const char *path, struct statx *info);
    int fstatx(int fd, struct statx *info);

DESCRIPTION
    Return inode metadata, including UID, GID and mode. statx searches
    the given path. fstatx works from an open descriptor. The calls
    return 0 on success or -1 on failure.

SEE ALSO
    chmod(1), chown(1)
